        "day2.highlights": "⛪ Kathedrale Porto (Sé) &amp; Miradouro da Sé — Panorama zum Start",
        "day2.highlights2": "🏛️ Mosteiro de Vairão (altes Benediktinerkloster)",
        "day2.versorgung": "☕ Cafés in Porto, Rio Tinto, Maia · 🛒 Supermärkte in Maia/Moreira · 🏧 Multibanco reichlich in Porto/Maia · 💊 Apotheken in Porto/Maia",
